Read ALL three v7 verdicts and check that EVERY finding is resolved, the FULL v8 design and its diff from v7, the oracle and its evidence, and check claims against actual Java and current Go. Challenge sufficiency and interactions (the boundary prune's class definition against every rule that yields predicate variants and against RFC-186's objection, what the prune can remove that PLANNING needs, the one-rule registration and DISABLE_PLANNER_REWRITING, the census populations, the temporal lane's closure under NOT/Commute/IN/explode and NULL, the IN-union and explode conversions, the tie rows), not only whether the requested words appear. Distinguish measured facts from remaining source hypotheses.
