Actual reviewer gate run via `claude -p` (model opus, effort xhigh) under a read-only tool policy (Read/Grep/Glob plus read-only git/grep/sed Bash; no Edit/Write). The owner authorized this substitution for the exhausted Codex account. No tests/probes/mutations/edits/staging/commits/push/CI/PR/publication/operational changes. Return ACK or NAK, the exact tree and design hash, and actionable findings with source line references ordered by severity. Incomplete review is not ACK. Under 900 words unless needed.

Apply the independent storage/wire correctness review lens: bytes a bound value stores (time.Time by instant, slices, the assignment lattice for every source, UTF-8 at bind and at save), index keys, isolation and read-conflict semantics (the measured read scope, always-snapshot sites, the index-state conflict range), DRY_RUN and snapshot admission, connection options and pool reset, continuation ownership, and write divergences.
